<title>CHINA: Shanghai Diesel Engine H1 net falls 28.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Diesel Engine H1 net falls 28.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated)</p>
<p> Turnover	  496.751	vs	 567.187</p>
<p> Net profit	 69.646	vs	  97.346</p>
<p> Net asset per share	3.35  yuan  (no comparative figure)</p>
<p> Earnings per share	 0.18  yuan  (no comparative figure)</p>
<p>Note: Shanghai Diesel Engine Co Ltd</p>
<p>is a producer of diesel engines. Figures are</p>
<p>unaudited.</p>
</text>
